* Code in the low part of the extra memory (>2000-3FFF), made up for testing the debugger.
* Try it: debug it. LOW MEMORY WORKS should appear at the top left.
        DEF   START
        REF   VMBW
        AORG  >2000

START   LWPI  WS
        LIMI  0
        LI    R0,>0000
        LI    R1,MSG
        LI    R2,MSGEND-MSG
        BLWP  @VMBW
DONE    JMP   DONE
MSG     TEXT  'LOW MEMORY WORKS'
MSGEND  EVEN
WS      BSS   32
        END   START
